WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.264
Energy is a practical resource that affects attention, quality, judgment, consistency,

00:00:04.264 --> 00:00:05.399
learning, and relationships.

00:00:05.399 --> 00:00:09.185
It is not the same as time, motivation, or discipline.

00:00:09.185 --> 00:00:13.727
Open calendar space may still lack usable capacity if attention is fragmented,

00:00:13.727 --> 00:00:18.648
emotional energy is depleted, cognitive load is high, or recovery has been neglected.

00:00:18.648 --> 00:00:21.298
Better planning begins by seeing capacity honestly.

00:00:21.298 --> 00:00:23.947
Strong energy management matches work to capacity.

00:00:23.947 --> 00:00:28.490
It uses high-energy windows for demanding work, batches shallow work where possible,

00:00:28.490 --> 00:00:29.625
reduces context switching,

00:00:29.625 --> 00:00:34.168
and designs routines that make important work easier to start and finish.

00:00:34.168 --> 00:00:39.088
It also reduces avoidable drains such as unclear priorities, open loops, excessive meetings,

00:00:39.088 --> 00:00:41.738
hidden emotional labor, constant availability, and rework.

00:00:41.738 --> 00:00:44.009
Recovery is not separate from performance.

00:00:44.009 --> 00:00:48.173
It is one of the conditions that makes sustainable performance possible.

00:00:48.173 --> 00:00:51.958
Breaks, transitions, movement, broad attention to basic needs, emotional decompression,

00:00:51.958 --> 00:00:55.744
and adequate non-work time all help preserve attention and judgment.

00:00:55.744 --> 00:00:57.258
This course stays non-clinical,

00:00:57.258 --> 00:01:01.800
but it is practical to recognize that people produce better work when

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:04.071
they are not treated like machines.

00:01:04.071 --> 00:01:06.721
The goal is not constant high intensity.

00:01:06.721 --> 00:01:10.885
The goal is reliable performance through better pacing, clearer priorities, recovery,

00:01:10.885 --> 00:01:12.399
and realistic workload design.

00:01:12.399 --> 00:01:13.913
At the team level,

00:01:13.913 --> 00:01:18.077
this means respecting shared capacity and reducing reliance on heroic effort.

00:01:18.077 --> 00:01:22.241
At the individual level, it means using energy deliberately, noticing patterns,

00:01:22.241 --> 00:01:27.540
and building systems that support real life rather than pretending limits do not exist.
